### unbraced variable reference
code='123'
echo $code
>>> none

### braced variable reference is fine
code='123'
echo ${code}
>>> none

### dollar inside single quotes is not an expansion
# shellcheck disable=SC2016
echo 'cost: $code'
>>> none

### special parameters and single digits are exempt
echo $* $1 $? $#
>>> SC2048 1:6
>>> SC2086 1:6
>>> SC2086 1:9

### expansion followed by equals and value
$option=42
>>> SC2154 1:1
>>> SC2281 1:1
